# v3 有界文件适配器与持久传输边界

这是离线准备版本。`android_directory_adapter.DEVICE_IO_DISABLED=True`，没有 CLI 或环境变量启用方式；默认导入/主入口不连接设备。原 v1/v2 未改。构造器仅绑定 Artifact 与计划，不触发设备 I/O：

```
AndroidDirectoryAdapter(adb, helper, txid, boot_id,
    scanner=scanner_artifact, io_helper=io_artifact,
    evidence_dir=new_host_directory,
    cancel_event=threading.Event(), transaction_deadline=host_monotonic_deadline)
```

公共方法保持 acquire/upload_helper/stage/inspect/inventory_optional/backup_to_mac/check_baseline/fresh_gate/seal/move。stage 可额外接收已经核实的 `raw_image=Artifact(...)`；否则在 Mac 将固定 gzip 流式解压到新文件，完整核 2 GiB 大小和固定 SHA 后才创建设备 stage。旧 `_shell` 任意脚本入口已关闭，内部固定操作通过私有 `_request`。没有块分区写入、reboot、删除目录、自动回滚或自动重试 API。

每请求最长 8 秒、输入最多 4 MiB、输出最多 16 MiB＋64 KiB、stderr 16 KiB。stdin 以 64 KiB 非阻塞渐进发送；stdout/stderr 同时按上限读取，不用 communicate 装入整个镜像。超时、SIGINT/SIGTERM、cancel_event、事务总截止、短输入/输出、错误退出码或任何 stderr 均停止。主机进程组被终止并有限等待回收；这不证明远端 syscall 已停止，远端状态仍可为 UNKNOWN。进程创建本身依赖主机 OS，不能声称内核阻塞的 spawn/kill/fsync 可被 Python 强制中断。

`BoundedTransport.request(label, argv, payload=..., output_limit=..., validator=..., mutating=False, deadline_s=8, op_id=..., transaction_deadline=..., metadata=..., followup=...)` 在启动前写入并 fsync IN_FLIGHT。mutating 必须有 followup；初始 ACK 仅是中间结果。followup 接收 `(parsed_ack, request_part)`，其独立短读只记录 PART_VERIFIED，不释放 ACTIVE。全部读回与校验通过后才写 COMPLETE；丢 ACK、读回错误或后置主机校验失败均毒化实例并落持久 UNCERTAIN。

生产共享状态固定为 `evidence/e5-clean-v3-device-state-DEVICE_SERIAL_REDACTED/`。包含 `STATE_BINDING.json`、host flock 的 `LOCK`、操作中的 `ACTIVE.json`、未知后的 `UNCERTAIN.json`、以及 `completed/<op_id>.json`。任一 ACTIVE/UNCERTAIN（包括悬空链接）会阻止同目录的新实例；不能通过换 evidence 目录绕过。每次操作的脚本/argv SHA、输入 SHA/字节数、boot/serial/tx/op ID、原始两流、计时、传输结果和部分读取留在独立证据目录。成功只移除当前 ACTIVE 标记，原始 IN_FLIGHT 永久留在操作证据目录；未知标记没有清除 API。独立只读 reconciliation 与一次性恢复 grant 由根线程另外实现、审查，不是本模块提供的自由 override。

读取采用固定 shell -T、root 引号、pipefail 和含 op/boot/path/offset/length/stat 的精确二进制封套。每段最多 16 MiB，另一个短请求读取同段并 SHA 对照；主机合并完整 SHA。baseline 只读原 B/misc/13 保护分区及固定 GPT 前缀；geometry 分分区短读。inspect 先后完整 metadata 清单一致且两次原生占用扫描成功，才返回原 session 的 inventory schema。

inspect 可复用本实例已完整双读的文件 SHA：键绑定 boot ID、完整 stat（dev/inode/size/mode/uid/gid/nlink/mtime/ctime 的精确文本，包括纳秒、rdev/type），不含路径以支持同 inode rename。任一同 inode 元数据变化或错误清除缓存；新进程/新 boot 不继承缓存，也没有外部缓存导入入口。写后读回与 backup 不用缓存。它仍不是原子快照或对不可观察并发修改的证明，必须结合新鲜占用扫描。

`backup_to_mac` 分块读取并二读 SHA 到新主机文件，再纯主机生成 tar、独立逐成员核 contents/type/uid/gid/mode。保留空目录；失败保留部分主机证据。外层 xattr/ACL/SELinux/atime 不承诺恢复，镜像内部元数据随原始字节保全。设备不再运行整 2 GiB sha/gzip/tar 请求。

stage 仅固定 8 项候选。普通文件每块最多 4 MiB，通过根线程的 native_io `write-file`：先接收整块并核短远端期限，再固定 stage 内 O_EXCL 首块/O_NOFOLLOW 后续块、inode/offset/size 校验、fsync。主机同一持久操作内做独立字节读回与再次 SHA，再接受该块完成。首块已有文件、错 inode、短写、坏 ACK 都不会覆盖重试。scanner/helper/io 小程序只允许经 bounded bootstrap 上传到固定 localtmp 名称；bootstrap 超时亦 UNKNOWN，不续传。每次调用 scanner/io/helper 前核相应上传文件 SHA。

全进程 mount/FD/cwd/root 和 global loop 清场由独立原生 scanner 保留，不能用只读备份 v2 的缩减扫描替代。scanner、rename helper 和 native_io 均另有短远端 BOOTTIME 期限和信号检查；seal/rename 调用必须使用本轮固定协议。rename helper 的 no-replace 与取消后 UNKNOWN 语义由其独审负责；host 不承诺 kill 保证阻塞 syscall 消失。

本模块 22 项真实主机管道测试＋20 项 fake/临时文件测试通过。测试分别运行，测试审计钩子禁止真实设备/网络；临时文件写只在 host fixtures。实际多 GiB 全流性能、Android native ABI、实时 scanner coverage、文件系统 fsync 和现场冷启动/原 B/misc 门仍需未来明确批准下验证。本轮没有设备/VM 调用。不能把离线测试当成已刷写或已验证实机恢复。

## Reviewed recovery transition hooks (still no device enable)

`BoundedTransport` now accepts optional `recovery_context`,
`reconciliation_only`, and `recovery_source_sha` constructor arguments. The
last must match the regular, singleton local `uncertainty_recovery.py` bytes
before either special mode is entered and before every such request. Normal
mode does not import that module. Recovery mode calls its `validate_context`
under the shared lock before every request and readback part. Context is exactly
`{request_sha256, txid, boot_id}`; only `write-boot_b` and `write-misc32` may be
marked mutating. The fixed caller still owns the actual command policy; a label
is not proof of a command's semantics.

`RECOVERY_PENDING.json` blocks all modes. `RECOVERY_ONLY.json` blocks ordinary
mode. Neither transport hook stages, clears, or finishes a grant. Those actions
remain with the separately pinned, independently reviewed recovery module.
An unresolved new ACTIVE/UNCERTAIN also blocks the recovery context.

Reconciliation-only accepts payload-free reads without a followup callback.
Its own ACTIVE, UNCERTAIN, and completed records live in its new evidence
directory. It holds the shared lock but leaves existing global ACTIVE,
UNCERTAIN, and completed evidence unchanged. Any failed read poisons that
instance and its local evidence. The policy backend must still restrict reads;
this generic host-pipe transport cannot infer whether arbitrary argv are reads.
The 30 transport tests include eight additional mode/pin/barrier tests with a
mocked grant validator; the root integration review must exercise the real
recovery validator and exact scope before any enabled use.

Nonmutating shell requests now wrap the complete guard and fixed script in
`busybox timeout -s TERM 6 /system/bin/sh -c`, with independent host deadline 8 s.
Native mutations retain their internal absolute deadline. The remote timeout
applet and target behavior still require the future read-only integration gate;
TERM is not proof of termination of an uninterruptible remote syscall. The fixed
fscrypt-probe file is created natively with mode 0700 and checked before write,
while other stage files are 0600; no extra broad chmod operation was added.

Before constructing or using real transport, the adapter now requires an explicit
unset cancel_event and a finite future monotonic transaction deadline no more
than 3600 seconds away. This is a phase budget: staging and final directory
switch may be separately reviewed phases; it is not an automatic renewal.
Missing, expired or nonfinite budgets fail before any transport/device call.
